pted Screenplay for The Graduate (1967) (alongside Calder Willingham) and for Best Director for Heaven Can Wait (1978) (alongside Warren Beatty).", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2022-05-19T11:00:37.250757+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 1766, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buck_Henry"}], "uuid": "bf8ebf7d-12e4-4eaf-9402-b0c67b31b29e", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": null, "external_references": [{"id": 7700, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q999332"}, {"id": 7701, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "56796406"}, {"id": 7702, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "n87150389"}, {"id": 7703, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-n87150389"}], "date_modified": "2023-06-14T16:33:30.576250+10:00"}, {"id": 80282, "name": "Laura Monaghan", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2377973, "title": "Rabbit-Proof Fence", "work_id": 93443, "role": "cast", "role_id": 33, "is_primary": false}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "1990", "date_of_death": "", "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-07-12T03:41:20.312411+10:00", "external_links": [], "uuid": "0dd58168-2a42-42f1-9317-9eefae5d4fd7", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "35640", "external_references": [], "date_modified": "2023-07-12T03:41:20.312722+10:00"}]}